// MapTiler basemap key — injected into Info.plist as MapTilerAPIKey (used from M6).
// This committed file ships NO key. To render basemap tiles, create an untracked
//   Config/maptiler.local.xcconfig
// containing:
//   MAPTILER_API_KEY = your_key_here
// (it is git-ignored and overrides the empty default below). scripts/release.sh instead takes
// the key from the MAPTILER_API_KEY environment variable when it is set, which outranks the
// local file; and at run time the app falls back to that variable when the plist has none.

MAPTILER_API_KEY =

#include? "maptiler.local.xcconfig"
